{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34747","headline":"奉和袭美伤开元观顾道士 · 张贲","name":"奉和袭美伤开元观顾道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤麟胶尽夜如何，共叹先生劒解多。\n几度吊来唯白鹤，此时乘去必青骡。\n图中含景随残照，琴里流泉寄逝波。\n惆怅真灵又空返，玉书谁授紫微歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张贲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34747.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34747","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}